  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "沿着轨道慢慢移动",
        "en": "Follow the wire track"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D1009/2370d177cdd1.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "手持探环沿金属轨道移动，是这款电碰迷宫的主要玩法。可以从较短的一段开始，观察探环与轨道的接触情况，再尝试走完一整条路线。",
        "en": "The main activity is moving the handheld loop along the wire track. Start with a short section, watch where the loop touches the wire, and then try the full route."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "看得见的电路组件",
        "en": "Visible circuit components"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D1009/f93ff6327a5e.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "套装展示电路底板、金属轨道、探环和指示灯等组件，连接关系可以直接观察。盒面标注4岁及以上、实验等级1，可配合实际操作认识这些组件各自的位置。",
        "en": "The set shows a baseboard, wire track, handheld loop and indicator light with visible connections. The box is marked ages 4+ and Level 1. Use the activity to identify where each part sits in the circuit."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "自备三节AA电池",
        "en": "Three AA batteries required"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/D1009/01f355856a0c.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "供电需要三节AA电池，电池不包含在套装内。包装与原备注的配件数量标注存在差异，具体件数请在下单时核对；本款货号D1009。",
        "en": "The kit requires three AA batteries, which are not included. The box and supplied notes show different component counts, so confirm the final count when ordering model D1009."
      }
    }
  ],
